Prompt Quality Lab

This repository contains software derived from Meta prompt-ops:
https://github.com/meta-llama/prompt-ops

The upstream source remains under the MIT License and retains its original
copyright notices. The LICENSE file in this repository is preserved from the
upstream project.

Downstream work maintained in this repository includes the offline JSONL
evaluation command, deterministic quality reports, baseline regression gates,
Unicode character-level F1, CI integration, examples, and Chinese project
documentation.

No claim is made that upstream prompt optimization modules were authored by
this downstream project.
